                <note rend="inline" type="source">825.51/1275a: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Ambassador in Chile</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Bowers</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1940-11-04T20:00:00-05:00">November 4, 1940—8
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>186. Department’s no. 182, October 31, 6 p.m. Decision with respect to credits
                    and other economic cooperation with Chile is being held up pending information
                    on the amount of exchange arrears owed to Americans. Please expedite reply.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
